==Event Information==
Wow! {{Color|#FF00FF|'''36 Million Downloads'''}} Worldwide!<br>
Time to celebrate!!!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Login between July 7th (11:00am) and 21st (11:00am) to join in on the party!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Special Celebration Stages!'''}}<br>
The baddest of the bad and the worst of the worst are here to take down the Cat Army! Will you let them defeat your Cat Army?!<br>
Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this event period to take on the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Deadly Carnival 2'''}}, or the classic {{Color|#FF0000|'''Deadly Carnival'''}} stages!<br>
Clear the first stage for a reward of 3 Normal Tickets, then clear the second stage for a Rare Ticket prize!<br>
Don't miss out on this awesome chance for tickets!<br>
<small><small>※If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.<br>
※Rewards will only be received upon the first stage clear.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Dark Descent Stages appear!'''}}<br>
A flood of shadowy evildoers invade The Battle Cats! Are you tough enough to stand against the fearsome challenge called the Dark Descent?!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Dark Descent'''}}<br>
July 7th (11:00) thru July 21st (10:59)!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Dark Descent II'''}}<br>
July 10th (11:00) thru July 21st (10:59)!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Dark Descent III'''}}<br>
July 13th (11:00) thru July 21st (10:59)!<br>
July 16th (11:00) thru July 21st (10:59)!

The Cat Empire needs YOU to take on this tough challenge! Don't let us down!<br>
<small><small>※If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Treasure Festival, On Now!'''}}<br>
During this event, get {{Color|#FF6600|'''increased Treasure Drop Rates'''}} in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Treasure Festival'''}}, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''odd days (7/7, 7/9, 7/11, 7/13, 7/15, 7/17, 7/19, 7/21)'''}} head to {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and {{Color|#008000|'''on even days (7/8, 7/10, 7/12, 7/14, 7/16, 7/18, 7/20)'''}} visit {{Color|#008000|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss a Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#335599|'''5/16, 5/19, 5/22, 5/25, and 5/28'''}}!<br>
<small><small>※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} each day of the campaign! Check in and profit!

